<script lang="ts">import type { Snippet } from 'svelte'; import type { HTMLButtonAttributes } from 'svelte/elements'; import { CheckCircle2, ChevronRight, Circle, CircleDot, CircleHelp, XCircle } from '@lucide/svelte'; import { cn } from '../../utils.js'; import { useTestSuiteContext } from './context.svelte.js'; interface Props extends Omit<HTMLButtonAttributes, 'children' | 'class'> { class?: string; children?: Snippet; } let { class: className = '', children, onclick, type = 'button', ...rest }: Props = $props(); const suite = useTestSuiteContext('TestSuiteName'); function toggle(event: MouseEvent & { currentTarget: EventTarget & HTMLButtonElement }): void { onclick?.(event); if (!event.defaultPrevented) suite.setOpen(!suite.open); }</script>
<button {...rest} {type} class={cn('svadmin-ai-tests-part__suite-name', `svadmin-ai-tests-part__suite-name--${suite.status}`, className)} aria-expanded={suite.open} data-slot="test-suite-name" onclick={toggle}><ChevronRight class={suite.open ? 'svadmin-ai-tests-part__chevron--open' : ''} size={14} aria-hidden="true" />{#if suite.status === 'passed'}<CheckCircle2 size={14} aria-hidden="true" />{:else if suite.status === 'failed'}<XCircle size={14} aria-hidden="true" />{:else if suite.status === 'running'}<CircleDot size={14} aria-hidden="true" />{:else if suite.status === 'todo'}<CircleHelp size={14} aria-hidden="true" />{:else}<Circle size={14} aria-hidden="true" />{/if}<span>{#if children}{@render children()}{:else}{suite.name}{/if}</span></button>
<style>.svadmin-ai-tests-part__suite-name { display: flex; width: 100%; align-items: center; gap: .45rem; padding: .65rem .75rem; border: 0; background: transparent; color: inherit; text-align: left; font: inherit; font-size: .76rem; cursor: pointer; }.svadmin-ai-tests-part__suite-name:hover { background: var(--muted, transparent); }.svadmin-ai-tests-part__suite-name:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--ring, currentColor); outline-offset: -2px; }.svadmin-ai-tests-part__suite-name > :global(svg:nth-child(2)) { color: var(--muted-foreground, currentColor); }.svadmin-ai-tests-part__suite-name--passed > :global(svg:nth-child(2)) { color: var(--success, currentColor); }.svadmin-ai-tests-part__suite-name--failed > :global(svg:nth-child(2)) { color: var(--destructive, currentColor); }.svadmin-ai-tests-part__suite-name--running > :global(svg:nth-child(2)) { color: var(--primary, currentColor); }.svadmin-ai-tests-part__chevron--open { transform: rotate(90deg); }</style>
